{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"88098","name":"Ilisia Hotel","description":"The hotel is situated in the town centre in a quiet business and residential area close to tourist attractions. The National Gallery, a concert hall, museums, embassies and various nightspots are all near the hotel, and it is 8 km from the airport and 10 km from Piraeus port. This hotel is located in a quiet central area overlooking a park and offers its guests free parking. It comprises a total of 90 rooms and the hotel's public areas and guestrooms were renovated in 2004. Facilities on offer to guests include a 24-hour reception and 24-hour check-in/out service, a bar and a restaurant. All the rooms are individually air-conditioned and feature a hairdryer, TV, a radio alarm clock, a fridge, a safe, a telephone and double-glazed windows. Furthermore, the rooms offer either a balcony or a terrace. The hotel offers its guests a complimentary full buffet breakfast.","address":"Michalakopoulou St. 25, 25","city":"ATHENS","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"11528","lat":37.975839616492,"lng":23.7519621918909,"stars":4,"giataCode":"83612","phone":"+302105205145","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/088098/088098a_hb_a_006.jpg?20240607141759?20250409215629?20250628154259","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/088098/088098a_hb_a_007.jpg?20241214133231?20250409215629?20250628154259","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/088098/088098a_hb_a_009.jpg?20241019053917?20250409215629?20250628154259","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/088098/088098a_hb_a_012.jpg?20241214133232?20250409215629?20250628154259","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/088098/088098a_hb_a_019.jpg?20241214133231?20250409215629?20250628154258","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds